          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.477,
            0.644,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "c. A triangle with no line of symmetry."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.223,
            0.5,
            0.884,
            0.521
          ],
          "content": "Is it possible to draw a triangle with exactly two lines of symmetry?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.529,
            0.884,
            0.572
          ],
          "content": "10. Draw the following. In each case, the figure should contain at least one curved boundary."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.575,
            0.711,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "a. A figure with exactly one line of symmetry."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.241,
            0.598,
            0.72,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": "b. A figure with exactly two lines of symmetry."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.241,
            0.62,
            0.725,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": "c. A figure with exactly four lines of symmetry."
